$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=rectintschx  LOC_AFTER=?

* The sharp Schwarz lemma on a rectangle: a holomorphic function vanishing at an interior point ` P ` is bounded at ` Q ` by its frame bound times ` abs ( Q - P ) / R ` , where ` R ` is below the four coordinate gaps of ` P ` ( ~ rectintmmx on the difference quotient).

